; This package owns the socket. Functorising over Mirage_flow.S rather than
; over an HTTP client is not a preference: the confidential Solo5 targets
; forbid NET_BASIC outright and sptmac has no networking at all, so vsock is
; the only transport available there. TLS composes as Tls_mirage.Make over the
; same signature.

(library
 (name cosmos_rpc_flow)
 (public_name cosmos-rpc-flow)
 (libraries cosmos-rpc lwt cstruct mirage-flow fmt))
